                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "That\u2019s a wrap, folks!\n\nWe just delivered our portion of President Trump\u2019s One Big Beautiful Bill\u2014unleashing American energy, rolling back the Green New Deal scam, securing Medicaid for our most vulnerable, and so much more.\n\nAnd it only took 26 hours, thanks to Democrats\u2019 endless pandering and political games.\n\nI\u2019d do it again in a heartbeat.",
