                "text": "The NONPARTISAN Congressional Budget Office\u00a0debunked\u00a0the Left\u2019s fear mongering on Medicaid. Here\u2019s what CBO confirms about President Trump\u2019s One Big Beautiful Bill passed by the House:\n\n- Only illegal immigrants and able-bodied adults refusing to work are removed.\n\n- Medicaid still\u00a0grows\u00a0over 30% in the next decade.\n\n- No cuts while rooting out waste, fraud, and abuse.\n\n- States save BILLIONS to reinvest in care for the truly vulnerable.\n\nDemocrats are defending fraud, illegal immigrants, and freeloaders. Republicans are protecting taxpayers\u00a0and\u00a0those who truly need help.",
